## Languages and Prompts

Support these 15 languages. For each, provide 3 prompts following this 
pattern — in native script with English context underneath:
1. Sensory memory (mother's kitchen, childhood sound, familiar smell)
2. Untranslatable word ("What word in your language has no English 
   equivalent? Use it in a sentence")
3. Celebration/community memory ("Remember a family or community 
   gathering. What do you feel?")

Languages: Swahili, Yoruba, Amharic, Arabic, Hindi, Mandarin, Cantonese, 
Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Portuguese, French (Cameroonian/Congolese 
context), Haitian Creole, Tagalog, Bengali

Use native script for all (Arabic script, Devanagari, Hangul, etc.)

