## Ethical Constraints (must appear visibly in the spec)
- AI never generates cultural content or speaks for a culture
- All prompts invoke the USER's memory, not AI's interpretation
- The feedback loop asks, never asserts
- "This is your voice. These words belong to you." — archive screen
- "Mizizi learns from you, not the other way around." — onboarding

